#: ../../source/FMManual/fm_intro.rst:6
msgid "安全事项"
msgstr "Safety Precautions"

#: ../../source/FMManual/fm_intro.rst:8
msgid "为确保用户安全正确使用本产品，避免对人员造成伤害，特制定安全事项。在使用本产品前，请务必认真阅读以下安全事项："
msgstr ""
"To ensure that users use this product safely and correctly and to prevent "
"personal injury, safety precautions are hereby established. Before using "
"this product, please be sure to carefully read the following safety "
"precautions:"

#: ../../source/FMManual/fm_intro.rst:10
msgid ""
"（1）本产品的适用性请由系统设计者或规格制定者来判断。 "
"本产品的使用条件具有多样化，请由系统的设计者或规格的制定者来判断系统的适用性。必要时请通过分析和测试进行判断。 "
"请在参考最新的产品资料、确认规格的全部内容、考虑到可能发生的故障，在此基础上构建系统。"
msgstr ""
"（1）The suitability of this product should be determined by the system "
"designer or the specification creator.  The usage conditions of this product"
" are diverse, and the suitability of the system should be determined by the "
"system designer or the specification creator. If necessary, make the "
"determination through analysis and testing.  Please construct the system on "
"the basis of referring to the latest product information, confirming the "
"entire content of the specifications, and taking possible failures into "
"account."

#: ../../source/FMManual/fm_intro.rst:12
msgid ""
"（2）请具有充分知识和经验的人员使用本产品。 在此所述产品若误操作会损害其安全性。 机械装置的组装、操作、维修保养等作业请由具有充分知识和经验的人执行。"
msgstr ""
"(2) Please have personnel with sufficient knowledge and experience use this "
"product.   Improper operation of the product described herein can impair its"
" safety.   Work such as the assembly, operation, and maintenance of "
"mechanical equipment should be performed by persons with sufficient "
"knowledge and experience."

#: ../../source/FMManual/fm_intro.rst:14
msgid "（3）请务必在确认机械、设备的安全之后，再进行产品的使用和拆卸。"
msgstr ""
"（3）Please be sure to confirm the safety of the machinery and equipment "
"before using or disassembling the product."

#: ../../source/FMManual/fm_intro.rst:16
msgid "请在确认已进行了移动体的落下防止对策和失控防止对策之后再进行机械、设备的使用和维护。"
msgstr ""
"Please use and maintain the machinery and equipment only after confirming "
"that fall-prevention measures for moving parts and runaway-prevention "
"measures have been implemented."

#: ../../source/FMManual/fm_intro.rst:17
msgid "请在确认已采取上述安全措施，并切断了能量源和设备电源以保证系统安全 的同时，确认和理解设备上产品个别注意事项的基础上，进行产品的拆卸。"
msgstr ""
"Please perform the disassembly of the product while confirming that the "
"above safety measures have been taken and that the energy source and "
"equipment power supply have been cut off to ensure system safety , and on "
"the basis of confirming and understanding the individual precautions for the"
" product on the equipment."

#: ../../source/FMManual/fm_intro.rst:18
msgid "重新启动机械、设备时，请对意外动作、误操作采取预防措施。"
msgstr ""
"When restarting machinery and equipment, please take preventive measures "
"against unexpected motion and erroneous operation."

#: ../../source/FMManual/fm_intro.rst:20
msgid "（4）在如下所示条件和环境下使用时，请在考虑安全对策的同时，提前向我司咨询。"
msgstr ""
"(4) When used under the conditions and environment shown below, please "
"consult our company in advance while also considering safety measures."

#: ../../source/FMManual/fm_intro.rst:22
msgid "明确记载的规格以外的条件或环境。"
msgstr "Conditions or environments other than those explicitly specified."

#: ../../source/FMManual/fm_intro.rst:23
msgid "使用于原子能、铁路、航空、宇宙设备、船舶、军用、医疗设备、食品用设备、燃料装置、安全设备等场合，以及用于非产品手册中的标准规格的场合。"
msgstr ""
"Used in applications such as nuclear power, railways, aviation, space "
"equipment, ships, military use, medical equipment, food equipment, fuel "
"devices, safety equipment, etc., as well as for applications involving "
"standard specifications not described in the product manual."

#: ../../source/FMManual/fm_intro.rst:24
msgid "预测对人身和财产有重大影响，特别是在有安全要求的场合使用时。"
msgstr ""
"Predictions have a significant impact on personal safety and property, "
"especially when used in applications where safety is required."

#: ../../source/FMManual/fm_intro.rst:25
msgid "用于互锁回路时，请设置应对故障的机械式保护功能，进行双重互锁。另外 进行定期检查以确认是否正常作动。"
msgstr ""
"When used in interlock circuits, please provide mechanical protection "
"functions against failures to achieve double interlocking. In addition,   "
"perform periodic inspections to confirm normal operation."

#: ../../source/FMManual/fm_intro.rst:28
msgid "总体介绍"
msgstr "General Introduction"

#: ../../source/FMManual/fm_intro.rst:33
msgid ""
"随着机器人市场规模的不断扩大，各行业对机器人关节的需求量也随之增长，促使企业开发更通用、高性能的关节产品，以满足市场的多样化需求，降低生产成本，提高市场竞争力。"
msgstr ""
"As the scale of the robot market continues to expand, the demand for robot "
"joints across various industries has grown accordingly, prompting companies "
"to develop more universal, high-performance joint products to meet the "
"diverse needs of the market, reduce production costs, and enhance market "
"competitiveness."

#: ../../source/FMManual/fm_intro.rst:35
msgid ""
"国内一些友商的关节产品已广泛运用于工业机器人、协作机器人，满足使用场景需求，强调产品的负载能力和可靠性。公司已有成熟的协作机器人用关节，也已开发了人形机器人的关节。综合已有的技术储备，开发尺寸小、重量轻、质量优、成本低的通用型关节紧紧围绕为客户解决问题，提供价值角度出发，打造属于自己的产品领域和蓝海。"
msgstr ""
"Some domestic peer companies' joint products have been widely applied in "
"industrial robots and collaborative robots, meeting application scenario "
"requirements, with emphasis on product load capacity and reliability. The "
"company already has mature joints for collaborative robots and has also "
"developed joints for humanoid robots. Based on existing technical reserves, "
"the development of general-purpose joints featuring small size, light "
"weight, high quality, and low cost will be firmly centered on solving "
"customer problems and delivering value, in order to build its own product "
"domain and blue ocean."

