#: ../../source/FMManual/fm_intro.rst:239
msgid "安装事项"
msgstr "Installation Notes"

#: ../../source/FMManual/fm_intro.rst:241
msgid "在安装之前，请认真阅读通用关节相关安全说明（1.1安全事项）。在固定好产品前，请勿提前打开电源。"
msgstr ""
"Before installation, please carefully read the safety instructions related "
"to the universal joint (1.1 safety precautions). Before securing the product"
" in place, do not turn on the power in advance."

#: ../../source/FMManual/fm_intro.rst:244
msgid "使用条件"
msgstr "Terms of Use"

#: ../../source/FMManual/fm_intro.rst:246
msgid "通用关节的操作及运输、存储条件为："
msgstr ""
"The operating, transportation, and storage conditions of the universal joint"
" are:"

#: ../../source/FMManual/fm_intro.rst:248
msgid "操作环境温度: 0℃～+45℃；"
msgstr "Operating ambient temperature: 0℃～+45℃；"

#: ../../source/FMManual/fm_intro.rst:249
msgid "操作环境湿度: 20%～90% RH（40°C）（无霜无结露）；"
msgstr ""
"Operating environment humidity: 20%～90% RH（40°C）（no frost and no "
"condensation）；"

#: ../../source/FMManual/fm_intro.rst:250
msgid "运输及储存温度: -20℃ ～ +60℃（无霜无结露）；"
msgstr ""
"Transportation and storage temperature: -20℃ ～ +60℃（no frost, no "
"condensation）；"

#: ../../source/FMManual/fm_intro.rst:252
msgid "通用关节须远离振动及冲击环境，环境不含灰尘、烟尘或水，不含腐蚀性气体、液体或爆炸性气体， 没有强大的电磁干扰源。"
msgstr ""
"Universal joints must be kept away from environments with vibration and "
"impact, the environment must be free of dust, fumes, or water, free of "
"corrosive gases, liquids, or explosive gases,   no strong sources of "
"electromagnetic interference."

