#: ../../source/FMManual/fm_intro.rst:691
msgid ""
"EtherCAT，全称 Ethernet for Control Automation Technology，由 Beckhoff Atuomation"
" GmbH 开发，是一种实时以太网用于主站和从站开放式的网络通信。 EtherCAT 作为成熟的工业以太网技术，具备高性能、低成本、使用简易等特点。"
msgstr ""
"EtherCAT, whose full name is  Ethernet for Control Automation Technology and"
" which was developed by  Beckhoff Atuomation GmbH , is a real-time Ethernet "
"used for open network communication between masters and slaves. As a mature "
"industrial Ethernet technology,  EtherCAT  features high performance, low "
"cost, and ease of use."

