"Dictionary, Drive Parameters (sDrivePara) Object Dictionary, Monitoring "
"Parameters (sDisplyPara) Object Dictionary, Tuning Parameters (sAdjPara) "
"Object Dictionary, Motion Control (sMtCtrlPara) Object Dictionary, "
"Protection Parameters (sKeepPara) Object Dictionary, Auxiliary Functions "
"(sAuxPara) Object Dictionary, Limit Parameters (sLmtPara) Object Dictionary,"
" Input/Output 1 (sIoPara1) Object Dictionary, Input/Output 2 (sIoPara2) "
"Object Dictionary, Adaptive PID Stiffness 0~2 Object Dictionary, Closed-loop"
" Feedforward Control Object Dictionary, Closed-loop PID Mode Object "
"Dictionary. For details, see Appendix 2: Sdo Read/Write Drive Full Parameter"
" Table -V0.4-20251208"

#: ../../source/FMManual/fm_intro.rst:843
msgid ""
"全参数读取&修改通过各个对象字典的子索引1参数命令完成。以基本设定对象为例，修改参数：修改密码、驱动器型号等子索引内容后，参数命令写1，将参数全部写入驱动器RAM中，完成后驱动器将参数命令置0；参数命令写2，将参数全部写入驱动器Flash中，完成后驱动器将参数命令置0。读取参数：参数命令写2，驱动器将参数放入基本设定SDO对象字典，随后将参数命令置0。"
msgstr ""
"Full-parameter reading&modification is accomplished through the sub-indexes "
"of each object dictionary1parameter commands. Taking the basic settings "
"object as an example, to modify parameters: after modifying sub-index "
"contents such as the modification password, drive model, etc., write 1 to "
"the parameter command, and all parameters will be written into the drive "
"RAM; after completion, the drive sets the parameter command to 0; write 2 to"
" the parameter command, and all parameters will be written into the drive "
"Flash; after completion, the drive sets the parameter command to 0. To read "
"parameters: write 2 to the parameter command, and the drive puts the "
"parameters into the basic settings SDO object dictionary, then sets the "
"parameter command to 0."

